      "content": "a \"quieter chapter\" doesn't really feel like something i want. it just feels like more of the same nothingness. what's even the point of a sequel when the original was so much better? it feels less like a new chapter and more like just dragging out an ending that's already happened. it's like... if the person i was is gone, then what am i even doing here holding on to this corpse of a life?",
